      "problem": "Consider the matrix $A$ given below.\nWhich entries of $A$ could be replaced by $0$ in order to get a matrix in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
